{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "חמרים", :translit "chamirim", :gloss "donkey-drivers"} {:he "הממעיט אסף עשרה חמרים", :translit "hamma'at aser asara chamirim", :gloss "the one who reduced gathered ten donkey-drivers"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["חמרים" "חמרים" "הממעיט אסף עשרה חמרים"]} {:kind :other, :note "The third Masorah occurrence is used to import the story of Genesis 43 into the reading of this verse."}], :frame {:text "In Genesis 43, Joseph's brothers return to Egypt to buy grain during the famine. Jacob tells them to take double silver and bring Benjamin down. Genesis 43:7, 43:12, and 43:15 are read by the Ba'al HaTurim as a pattern: the brothers recount what happened, Jacob instructs them to take additional silver as a precaution, and they take provisions and gifts. The phrase הממעיט אסף עשרה חמרים from Genesis 43:32 describes how the one of lesser standing gathered ten donkey-drivers — read as Jacob (the diminished patriarch in famine) assembling his ten sons who would drive donkeys laden with grain. By counting חמרים three times in the Masorah and placing this instance in Exodus 8:10, he draws the two passages together so that the same number that governs the brothers' donkey-drivers governs the reading of the frogs here.", :sources ["Genesis 43:7" "Genesis 43:12" "Genesis 43:15" "Genesis 43:32"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["חמרים" "חמרים" "הממעיט אסף עשרה חמרים"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "חמרים", :refs ["Genesis 45:23" "Numbers 11:32" "Judges 19:3" "2 Samuel 16:1" "Ezra 2:67" "Nehemiah 7:68"], :n 6, :lens :exact} {:phrase "חמרים", :refs ["Genesis 45:23" "Numbers 11:32" "Judges 19:3" "2 Samuel 16:1" "Ezra 2:67" "Nehemiah 7:68"], :n 6, :lens :exact} {:phrase "הממעיט אסף עשרה חמרים", :refs ["Numbers 11:32"], :n 1, :lens :exact}]} {:kind :other, :note "The third Masorah occurrence is used to import the story of Genesis 43 into the reading of this verse.", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:14:25.923925854Z", :model "glm-5.2"}